00:26:41.000 --> 00:26:58.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay, perfect. Um, so this was all outlined in your contract, but just as a, um, refresher, we are customizing an ad strategy, um, specifically for your business. Um, I know you said you want to be somewhere within the range of to, I think, $1,000 to $2,000.

00:26:58.000 --> 00:27:07.000
Whitney Hodges: Um, a month, um, which is great, so we'll customize an ad strategy with a variety of different objectives across Google and, um, Meta.

00:27:07.000 --> 00:27:22.000
Whitney Hodges: We do, you know, write all of the ad copy, designed the creatives and headlines. You know, sometimes we will kind of lean into existing organic content that you have on Instagram in particular.

00:27:22.000 --> 00:27:42.000
Whitney Hodges: and repurpose that, um, into ads, right? Or enhance it to turn it into ads. Um, because we do find, um, oftentimes that ads that, um, feel a bit more organic, um, can perform, you know, really well. It doesn't necessarily feel like somebody is just, like, being sold to as they're being.

00:27:42.000 --> 00:28:00.000
Whitney Hodges: You know, as they're scrolling or on Facebook and Instagram, it more feels like they're just, you know, scrolling, kind of consuming content and seeing more and more of you. Of course, you know, the funnel strategy support and lead block, as we mentioned.

