00:35:31.000 --> 00:35:48.000
Whitney Hodges: So, um, when you start off as a new advertiser, especially on Google and, um, Meta, like, they are going to be billing you directly for your ad spend. You know, we're gonna have your credit card on file with, with both of those, those platforms. So, you will see, you know, over the course of each month.

