00:35:57.000 --> 00:36:12.000
Whitney Hodges: small but frequent charges, like, you know, even on Meta, I've sometimes seen, like, charges that are, like, going through every day, sort of thing. So, just something to be, like, mindful of and aware of, and if you need to make your credit card company or your, um, bank aware.

00:36:12.000 --> 00:36:16.000
Whitney Hodges: Um, you… you definitely can. Um…

00:36:16.000 --> 00:36:30.000
